<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on CS Group registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Bank said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    180 CHF		   PREMIUM	8.38 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.05 CHF		  GEARING	9.02 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 12.JUN.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	11.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  185 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
